+    CheckpointArgs, CheckpointOutcome, CompressArgs, CompressOutcome, EvictArgs, EvictOutcome,
+    ExpandArgs, ExpandOutcome, FilterPredicate, OpContext, PhaseFourResources, PhaseFourRetriever,
