+- `WorkingMemorySummary` was not serializable, so serde support was added in the working-memory operations layer to keep the MCP response schema aligned with the Rust type.
+- The daemon did not yet have a session-scoped working-memory cache or checkpoint lookup helper, so those were added through the existing `MemoryStore` and MCP handler instead of creating a parallel storage path.
+
+Final status: complete

