Implemented T36 end to end.

The daemon now exposes `inspect_working_memory`, with compact and diagnostic modes, session-state lookup plus latest-checkpoint fallback, and snapshot expansion handles. Working-memory state mutations now carry before/after state through the single mutation observer hook, and the new event hook module emits `MemoryRetrieved` and `MemoryExpanded` events with included/excluded context diffs and reasons.

